StreamAV-Bench bundles minimal runtime subsets of external evaluator projects
under third_party/. Model checkpoints are downloaded separately.

- third_party/vbench_long contains VBench / VBench-Long runtime source licensed
  under Apache-2.0.
- third_party/synchformer contains Synchformer runtime source licensed under MIT.
  Its AST and Motionformer-derived files retain their original notices.
- third_party/imagebind contains ImageBind runtime source under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
- ImageBind checkpoints retain their own CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 terms.
- OpenAI CLIP is licensed under MIT.
- Audiobox Aesthetics and the LAION Aesthetic Predictor retain their package,
  checkpoint, and model terms.
- NBC/PVC transition diagnostics are independently implemented with attribution
  to LongAV-Compass; no LongAV-Compass source code is included.

Users must comply with all upstream terms. The StreamAV-Bench MIT License does
not relicense files under third_party/ or downloaded model assets. Sources and
checkpoint links are listed in docs/dependencies.md.
